<description>&lt;p&gt;Aung San Suu Kyi spoke with her son for the first time in over five years, and he said she sounded fairly healthy. Military commander Min Aung Hlaing met Japan envoy Sasakawa, showing diplomatic engagement despite ongoing fighting. At least two people were killed in a blast in the Rakhine state capital. The conflict still caused 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxPMEoyNTRacGFNellGb0JqTUVRYXNWbWxoZkczZmFuLU1FczhkZEFsYUV6Nk1Iay1Jc2xDc0F0aDFGUEhEZHBHdlFka0p3czBFb0dRSEF4UjRkUnliVERuNkNiVkRmZHhrMnA5US01a3BaZ0o1TG1PMXJWZjNRb1A0bklWNVNvTURROWtYQjl1XzYzMjQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxQazlnbmRtMzdIN0gtdnVMZ0g5QlIxTFJZMU9zMk50UlV3QVp2eVFBLWJUUGhIQnQ1T21CWEZVV2dyN09BOF8yREt3RThUTjZzV0xObEtaMDJVZXNmV0ZRTGlKRmk4SldyNnNLaTAtS3VmY3c4TGhEcUQxVEZ5bGxPMmFDZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxNaDQ3bFMyVWV0aHB5RXdQMVpuOWVMZzVWS3BBZTRHU196Wk95SHQwMTBrRkhoVzgzT2RlNUJWVnVPYWgwNm5MZy1adE1aQ3ZCSHJXb1BpcHVBOXhRZVVJWUpJYzBLOEc3clctNVo5MFpBUld4amFobWVISGhvaGthZE1SVndDOXl6aDlJaA?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiY0FVX3lxTFA4eFFtbFV4MUhtcS1TWld0bGdkWFlKY2pZU3U2cUgyTENPNFg2QnFHVUE1YW5FQi1WWW02RUY5WmNBejF0ZXl4dXJMaWw5aU9ZUzBEcHJHTTZ3VVdjcXpqSjYzZ9IBY0FVX3lxTFA4eFFtbFV4MUhtcS1TWld0bGdkWFlKY2pZU3U2cUgyTENPNFg2QnFHVUE1YW5FQi1WWW02RUY5WmNBejF0ZXl4dXJMaWw5aU9ZUzBEcHJHTTZ3VVdjcXpqSjYzZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPTG9VN0VTWFlWWXk3c0JiRW5VVzRTUmVRUUtxb04ySFBsVlo3Zk5xYUZ2TFA4MU82dFlyNE9qZTh3WUo3MnZFby1qcW9jc